Yep, but life goes on. Dee Dee got the sense that Abraham was planning to take off at any moment. Then one day he told her he'd obtained a fake passport under the name Rod Regas. Abraham began working to break his ties to Lakeland as quickly as possible. He offered to sell Dee Dee his house for a little over $500,000. She didn't have that much money, but the pair reached an agreement. Dee Dee could live in the house and make small purchases for Abraham such as flights or cruise tickets as a gradual means of paying off the debt. Abraham then asked for Dee Dee's help to make him disappear.
“是的，但生活还要继续。”迪迪感觉到亚伯拉罕正计划随时离开。然后有一天，他告诉她他以“罗德·雷加斯”的名字获得了一本假护照。亚伯拉罕开始努力尽快切断与莱克兰的联系。他提出以50多万美元的价格把房子卖给迪迪。她没有那么多钱，但两人达成了一项协议。迪迪可以住在房子里，并为亚伯拉罕进行小额购买，例如机票或游轮票，作为逐步偿还债务的一种方式。亚伯拉罕随后请求迪迪帮助他消失。

